                    </mxGeometry>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="x6qsR24moG9_k1Nxf-bd-73" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 31px;&quot;&gt;Perform the k-index coverage report flow at&lt;/font&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 31px;&quot;&gt;&lt;pre dir=&quot;ltr&quot;&gt;&lt;code&gt;[start_utc &lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(163, 36, 36), rgb(237, 237, 237));&quot;&gt;- kindex_lag_count × 3 hours&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;, end_utc)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;- Note the start_utc is already lag-adjusted to&lt;br&gt;ensure that we can construct lag-`kindex_lag_count` &lt;br&gt;K-index features as well.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];" vertex="1" connectable="0" parent="x6qsR24moG9_k1Nxf-bd-25">
